{
  "id": "RAW_c7a771d3a4",
  "title": "H 公司发布 NeoMME：包含 260M 和 800M 参数的单塔多模态编码器系列，摒弃视觉塔与因果解码器",
  "url": "https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/09/06/h-company-releases-neomme-a-family-of-260m-and-800m-single-tower-multimodal-encoders-that-drop-the-vision-tower-and-causal-decoder/",
  "date": "2026-09-07 05:06:43",
  "author": "Asif Razzaq",
  "siteName": "MarkTechPost",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Most visual document retrievers in production today are hand-me-downs. <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.01449\">ColPali</a> and the models that followed it take a generative vision-language model and repurpose it as an encoder. The result still carries a separately pretrained vision tower and a causal decoder that never generates a token. That is parameter and compute overhead for a task that only needs representations.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Hcompany\">H Company</a> has released <strong>NeoMME</strong>, a family of 260M and 800M bidirectional encoders that drops both components. One Transformer processes multilingual text tokens and raw 32×32 RGB image patches through the same layers, trained from random initialization. The retrieval fine-tune, NeoMME-Retriever, reaches 0.523 nDCG@10 on <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.17166\">ViDoRe v3</a> at 260M parameters.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Is it deployable?</strong> Yes. Every checkpoint ships under Apache 2.0 with day-zero support in <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main/en/model_doc/neomme\">Hugging Face Transformers</a>. The 260M model indexes 51.3 pages per second on a single NVIDIA L40S and encodes a query in 78.3 ms on a CPU-only host.</p>\n  <div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n   <figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\">\n    <img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"82156\" data-permalink=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/09/06/h-company-releases-neomme-a-family-of-260m-and-800m-single-tower-multimodal-encoders-that-drop-the-vision-tower-and-causal-decoder/screenshot-2026-09-06-at-2-06-00-pm/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-06-at-2.06.00-PM.png\" data-orig-size=\"1518,760\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-06 at 2.06.00 PM\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-06-at-2.06.00-PM-1024x513.png\" data-src=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-06-at-2.06.00-PM.png\" src=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-06-at-2.06.00-PM.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-82156 lazyload\">\n    <figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">\n     <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.01657\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.01657</a>\n    </figcaption>\n   </figure>\n  </div>\n  <h2 id=\"h-one-tower-two-modalities\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>One tower, two modalities</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Text enters through an ALBERT-style factorized embedding: a 256-dimensional lookup projected to model width. Images are split into non-overlapping 32×32 patches and projected by a 2-layer MLP trained from scratch. No patch-merging module, no <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.14786\">SigLIP2</a> tower.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Both models support a 16,384-token context, enough for two standard 3,840×2,160 4K UHD images after patching. Most layers use symmetric sliding-window attention; every sixth layer and the final layer attend globally. The stack uses grouped-query attention, query-key normalization, gated attention, 2D rotary position embeddings, and squared-ReLU MLPs. Exact parameter counts are 262,937,906 and 793,715,032.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The tokenizer is a whitespace-unconstrained BPE with a 131,072-entry vocabulary, trained from scratch. Across 14 target languages in FLORES-200 devtest, it emits 44.4% fewer tokens than <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/blog/modernbert\">ModernBERT</a>.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-trained-as-a-masked-diffusion-denoiser\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Trained as a masked diffusion denoiser</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pretraining is discrete masked diffusion over text, optionally conditioned on visible image patches. Text-only segments draw a corruption rate uniformly from 0 to 1. Multimodal segments draw from 0.30 to 1, which removes the language-only shortcut and forces the model to read the page.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A cross-modal ablation probe confirms this works. At 90% masking, visible page patches raise masked-token accuracy by 38.4 points for the 260M model and 40.5 points for the 800M model. Each run processes about 524 billion packed input tokens, roughly 290 billion of them text-only, on 16 and 32 H100 accelerators respectively.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-retrieval-results\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Retrieval results</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">NeoMME-Retriever adds two jointly trained heads on the shared backbone: a mean-pooled dense head with Matryoshka widths, and a late-interaction head projecting every token and patch to 128 dimensions. One forward pass returns both.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On ViDoRe v3, the 260M model scores 0.523 nDCG@10 and the 800M model 0.556. The 260M result sits within 0.002 of <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/vidore/colqwen2.5-v0.2\">ColQwen2.5-v0.2</a> at 3.75B parameters, and 26.1 points above the best other sub-300M model. The 800M model lands 0.9 points behind the similarly sized <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/vultr/VultronRetrieverFlash-Qwen3.5-0.8B\">Vultron Retriever Flash</a>. On ViDoRe v1 and v2 the models reach 0.860/0.522 and 0.874/0.559 nDCG@5.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Text retrieval is weaker. On BEIR-15, late interaction reaches 0.4881 and 0.5126, against 0.5722 for <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/lightonai/LateOn\">LateOn</a> at 149M parameters. The authors attribute this partly to supervision scale: NeoMME saw roughly 430K text query examples, against roughly 660M contrastive examples for mLateOn.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-storage-and-throughput\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Storage and throughput</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Late-interaction indexes are expensive. A 2048×2048 page yields 4,162 vectors, about 1.5 MB per ViDoRe v3 document in float32. Two methods bring that down. <a href=\"https://www.answer.ai/posts/colbert-pooling.html\">Hierarchical token pooling</a> at factor 10 with int8 queries and documents gives 39.0 kB per page, a 39.4× reduction retaining 99.16% of baseline nDCG@10. Pool factor 8 with int8 queries and binary documents gives 6.0 kB, a 255.5× reduction retaining 95.19%.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Indexing is fast for the vector count. At a matched 2048×2048 input on one L40S, NeoMME-260M encodes 51.3 pages per second against ColModernVBERT’s 26.0, a 1.97× gap.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-interactive-explainer\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Interactive explainer</strong></h2>\n  <div id=\"mtp-neomme-explainer\">\n   <iframe class=\"lazyload\" id=\"mtp-neomme-frame\" title=\"NeoMME interactive explainer\" height=\"600\" scrolling=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" srcdoc=\"&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;\n&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\n  :root{\n    --paper:#EFEFEB;\n    --ink:#14161C;\n    --crimson:#C81E33;\n    --slate:#3B5B8C;\n    --muted:#6E7280;\n    --rule:#D6D6CE;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--paper);}\n  body{\n    font-family:&quot;Iowan Old Style&quot;,&quot;Palatino Linotype&quot;,Palatino,Georgia,serif;\n    color:var(--ink);\n    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  }\n  .wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 20px 14px;}\n  .masthead{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;\n    border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n  .mark{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:600;}\n  .mark i{font-style:normal;color:var(--crimson);}\n  .mast-sub{font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);}\n\n  .stage{position:relative;min-height:352px;}\n  .panel{display:none;animation:rise .34s ease both;}\n  .panel.on{display:block;}\n  @keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}\n\n  h3{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 4px;letter-spacing:-.01em;}\n  .lede{font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3E48;margin:0 0 14px;max-width:66ch;}\n  .note{font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px;max-width:70ch;}\n\n  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:14px;}\n  .chip{font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    font-size:12px;padding:5px 11px;border:1px solid var(--rule);background:#fff;color:#40444E;\n    border-radius:2px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,color .18s,border-color .18s;}\n  .chip:hover{border-color:var(--ink);}\n  .chip[aria-pressed=&quot;true&quot;]{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink);}\n  .chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--crimson);outline-offset:2px;}\n\n  /* Panel 1: tower diagram */\n  .tower{display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n  .tcol{flex:1 1 300px;min-width:270px;}\n  .rig{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:7px;}\n  .feeds{display:flex;gap:28px;}\n  .feed{text-align:center;}\n  .flabel{font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:5px;}\n  .dots{display:flex;gap:4px;justify-content:center;}\n  .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:1px;}\n  .dot.t{background:var(--slate);}\n  .dot.i{background:var(--crimson);}\n  .flow{animation:drop 1.5s linear infinite;}\n  .flow.d2{animation-delay:.25s;}\n  .flow.d3{animation-delay:.5s;}\n  @keyframes drop{0%{opacity:.15;transform:translateY(-3px);}45%{opacity:1;transform:none;}100%{opacity:.15;transform:translateY(3px);}}\n  .pipe{width:2px;height:16px;background:var(--rule);}\n  .blk{width:100%;max-width:330px;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:#fff;padding:9px 12px;text-align:center;\n    font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;\n    transition:background .25s,color .25s,border-color .25s;}\n  .blk small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);}\n  .blk.hot{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink);}\n  .blk.hot small{color:#B9BCC4;}\n  .blk.warn{border-color:var(--crimson);border-style:dashed;}\n  .blk.warn small{color:var(--crimson);}\n  .split{display:flex;gap:10px;width:100%;max-width:330px;}\n  .split .blk{max-width:none;}\n  .stat{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:10px;margin-top:2px;}\n  .statrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:5px 0;\n    font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;\n    border-bottom:1px dotted var(--rule);}\n  .statrow b{font-weight:600;}\n\n  /* Panel 2: masking */\n  .sentence{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--rule);padding:12px;min-height:74px;\n    font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:2;}\n  .tok{display:inline-block;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 2px;background:#E7E7E1;border-radius:2px;\n    transition:background .3s,color .3s,transform .3s;}\n  .tok.mask{background:var(--crimson);color:#fff;transform:scale(1.02);}\n  .rng{width:100%;margin:16px 0 4px;accent-color:var(--crimson);}\n  .zone{display:flex;font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);justify-content:space-between;}\n  .gain{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px;}\n  .gainbox{border-left:3px solid var(--crimson);padding:2px 0 2px 10px;}\n  .gainbox b{display:block;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.02em;}\n  .gainbox span{font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);}\n\n  /* Panel 3: resolution */\n  .resgrid{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start;}\n  .page{position:relative;width:170px;height:170px;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:#fff;\n    background-image:linear-gradient(var(--rule) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--rule) 1px,transparent 1px);\n    background-size:34px 34px;transition:background-size .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);}\n  .page b{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-22px;font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;}\n  .resnums{flex:1 1 300px;min-width:260px;}\n  .bar{height:9px;background:#E1E1DA;position:relative;margin:4px 0 2px;}\n  .bar i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:var(--slate);transition:width .5s ease;}\n  .bar.b2 i{background:var(--crimson);}\n\n  /* Panel 4: compression */\n  .steps{display:flex;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--rule);background:#fff;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n  .steps .chip{border:0;border-right:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:0;flex:1 1 auto;text-align:center;}\n  .shrink{height:38px;background:var(--crimson);transition:width .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);min-width:3px;}\n  .shrinkwrap{background:#E1E1DA;height:38px;position:relative;}\n  .kpis{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px;}\n\n  /* Panel 5: throughput */\n  .tp{margin-top:4px;}\n  .tprow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px 1fr 74px;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:4px 0;\n    font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;}\n  .tprow em{font-style:normal;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;display:block;}\n  .tbar{height:14px;background:#DCDCD5;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}\n  .tbar i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:0;background:var(--slate);transition:width .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);}\n  .tprow.us .tbar i{background:var(--crimson);}\n  .tprow.us{font-weight:600;}\n  .tpv{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}\n\n  /* nav */\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;\n    border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:16px;padding-top:12px;}\n  .pips{display:flex;gap:7px;}\n  .pip{width:26px;height:3px;background:var(--rule);border:0;padding:0;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s;}\n  .pip[aria-current=&quot;true&quot;]{background:var(--crimson);}\n  .pip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--crimson);outline-offset:3px;}\n  .arrows{display:flex;gap:8px;}\n  .arrow{font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;\n    padding:6px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--ink);color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;border-radius:2px;}\n  .arrow:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;}\n  .arrow[disabled]{opacity:.32;cursor:default;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);}\n  .count{font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);}\n\n  .foot{margin-top:12px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\n    gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);}\n  .foot a{color:var(--slate);}\n  .foot .brand{color:var(--crimson);font-weight:600;}\n\n  @media (max-width:640px){\n    .wrap{padding:16px 14px 12px;}\n    .mark{font-size:19px;}\n    h3{font-size:17px;}\n    .stage{min-height:0;}\n    .tower{gap:16px;}\n    .tprow{grid-template-columns:112px 1fr 58px;font-size:11px;}\n    .page{width:140px;height:140px;}\n    .split{flex-direction:column;}\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n    *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;}\n  }\n&lt;/style&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;wrap&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;masthead&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;mark&quot;&gt;Neo&lt;i&gt;MME&lt;/i&gt; explained&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;mast-sub&quot;&gt;Five interactive panels &amp;middot; every number from the technical report&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;stage&quot;&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- PANEL 1 --&gt;\n    &lt;section class=&quot;panel on&quot; id=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;h3&gt;One Transformer instead of a stack of borrowed parts&lt;/h3&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;lede&quot;&gt;Pick an architecture to see where text and image tokens actually go. NeoMME drops the pretrained vision tower and the causal decoder, so both modalities share every layer.&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;chips&quot; id=&quot;archChips&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-a=&quot;0&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Dual-tower (SigLIP2)&lt;/button&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-a=&quot;1&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot;&gt;VLM as encoder (ColQwen2.5)&lt;/button&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-a=&quot;2&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot;&gt;ModernVBERT&lt;/button&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-a=&quot;3&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;NeoMME&lt;/button&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;tower&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;tcol&quot;&gt;\n          &lt;div class=&quot;rig&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;feeds&quot;&gt;\n              &lt;div class=&quot;feed&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flabel&quot;&gt;Image&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dots&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;span class=&quot;dot i flow&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dot i flow d2&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dot i flow d3&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class=&quot;feed&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flabel&quot;&gt;Text&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dots&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;span class=&quot;dot t flow d2&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dot t flow&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dot t flow d3&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;pipe&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;split&quot; id=&quot;stemRow&quot;&gt;\n              &lt;div class=&quot;blk&quot; id=&quot;stemL&quot;&gt;Vision encoder&lt;small&gt;pretrained&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class=&quot;blk&quot; id=&quot;stemR&quot;&gt;Tokenizer&lt;small&gt;text&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;pipe&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;blk hot&quot; id=&quot;core&quot;&gt;Multimodal encoder&lt;small&gt;bidirectional&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;pipe&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;blk&quot; id=&quot;tail&quot;&gt;Hidden states&lt;small&gt;one per token or patch&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;tcol&quot;&gt;\n          &lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;statrow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pretrained vision tower&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;no&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;statrow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Causal decoder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;no&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;statrow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Attention over inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;bidirectional&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;statrow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Image handling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;raw 32&amp;times;32 patches&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;statrow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Parameters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;260M / 800M&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot; id=&quot;archNote&quot;&gt;NeoMME is trained from random initialization. Text uses a factorized 256-dimensional embedding; each 32&amp;times;32 RGB patch is projected by a 2-layer MLP.&lt;/p&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/section&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- PANEL 2 --&gt;\n    &lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;h3&gt;Hide the words, keep the pixels&lt;/h3&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;lede&quot;&gt;Drag the corruption rate. At low masking the model can guess from surrounding text alone. Multimodal examples are drawn from 30% upward, which strips that shortcut away.&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;sentence&quot; id=&quot;sent&quot; aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;input class=&quot;rng&quot; id=&quot;mask&quot; type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;100&quot; step=&quot;5&quot; value=&quot;30&quot; aria-label=&quot;Text corruption rate&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;zone&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;0% &amp;middot; text-only examples start here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;maskV&quot;&gt;30% masked&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;100%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;gain&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;gainbox&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;+38.4 pts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;NeoMME-260M masked-token accuracy gained from visible page patches, at 90% masking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;gainbox&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;+40.5 pts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;NeoMME-800M, same probe and same masking rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;Measured over the final 50 cross-modal ablation probes. Both models show positive image gain at every tested rate, and the gain grows as text context is removed.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;/section&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- PANEL 3 --&gt;\n    &lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;h3&gt;Resolution buys quality, and costs vectors&lt;/h3&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;lede&quot;&gt;Choose a longest-side cap. The grid shows patch density for a square page; the bars show ViDoRe v3 nDCG@10 for both retrievers.&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;chips&quot; id=&quot;resChips&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-r=&quot;0&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot;&gt;768 px&lt;/button&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-r=&quot;1&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot;&gt;1,024 px&lt;/button&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-r=&quot;2&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot;&gt;1,536 px&lt;/button&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-r=&quot;3&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;2,048 px&lt;/button&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;resgrid&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;page&quot; id=&quot;page&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;pageCap&quot;&gt;4,162 vectors per square page&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;resnums&quot;&gt;\n          &lt;div class=&quot;statrow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Raw float32 late-interaction size&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;rBytes&quot;&gt;2.13 MB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:12px;&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;statrow&quot; style=&quot;border:0;padding-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;NeoMME-260M &amp;middot; ViDoRe v3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;r260&quot;&gt;0.5226&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;i id=&quot;bar260&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;statrow&quot; style=&quot;border:0;padding:10px 0 2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;NeoMME-800M &amp;middot; ViDoRe v3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;r800&quot;&gt;0.5560&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;bar b2&quot;&gt;&lt;i id=&quot;bar800&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;Bars are scaled to a 0.60 nDCG@10 ceiling. Downscale only: pages smaller than the cap keep their native size.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;/section&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- PANEL 4 --&gt;\n    &lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;h3&gt;From 1.5 MB a page down to 6 kB&lt;/h3&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;lede&quot;&gt;Step through the three measured index settings for NeoMME-260M on ViDoRe v3. The bar is the stored bytes for one average page.&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;steps&quot; id=&quot;cmpSteps&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-c=&quot;0&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;float32, no pooling&lt;/button&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-c=&quot;1&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot;&gt;pool 10 + int8 / int8&lt;/button&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;chip&quot; data-c=&quot;2&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot;&gt;pool 8 + int8 / binary&lt;/button&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;shrinkwrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;shrink&quot; id=&quot;shrink&quot; style=&quot;width:100%&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;kpis&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;gainbox&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;cSize&quot;&gt;1,536.7 kB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;stored per document&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;gainbox&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;cComp&quot;&gt;1&amp;times;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;index compression&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;gainbox&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;cQual&quot;&gt;100%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;of float32 nDCG@10 retained&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;Hierarchical token pooling averages clustered page vectors. Asymmetric quantization keeps queries at higher precision because they are never stored.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;/section&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- PANEL 5 --&gt;\n    &lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot; id=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;h3&gt;Indexing throughput on a single NVIDIA L40S&lt;/h3&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;lede&quot;&gt;Median pages per second at each model's largest effective square, compiled, with a separately calibrated batch size. Larger squares mean more pixels encoded per page.&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;tp&quot; id=&quot;tp&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;NeoMME-260M encodes 2048&amp;times;2048 pages at 1.97&amp;times; ColModernVBERT's rate. NeoMME-800M still leads Vultron Flash while processing 31% more image pixels.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;/section&gt;\n\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;nav&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;pips&quot; id=&quot;pips&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;span class=&quot;count&quot; id=&quot;count&quot;&gt;1 / 5&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;arrows&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;button class=&quot;arrow&quot; id=&quot;prev&quot; disabled&gt;Back&lt;/button&gt;\n      &lt;button class=&quot;arrow&quot; id=&quot;next&quot;&gt;Next&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;foot&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;span&gt;Sources: &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.01657&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;arXiv 2609.01657&lt;/a&gt; &amp;middot; &lt;a href=&quot;https://huggingface.co/blog/Hcompany/neomme&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;H Company on Hugging Face&lt;/a&gt; &amp;middot; &lt;a href=&quot;https://hf.co/collections/Hcompany/neomme&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;model collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;span class=&quot;brand&quot;&gt;Built by Marktechpost&lt;/span&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;script&gt;\n(function(){\n  var panels=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.panel'));\n  var idx=0, pips=document.getElementById('pips');\n  var prev=document.getElementById('prev'), next=document.getElementById('next'), count=document.getElementById('count');\n\n  panels.forEach(function(_,i){\n    var b=document.createElement('button');\n    b.className='pip'; b.type='button';\n    b.setAttribute('aria-label','Panel '+(i+1));\n    b.setAttribute('aria-current', i===0?'true':'false');\n    b.addEventListener('click',function(){go(i);});\n    pips.appendChild(b);\n  });\n\n  function go(i){\n    idx=Math.max(0,Math.min(panels.length-1,i));\n    panels.forEach(function(p,k){p.classList.toggle('on',k===idx);});\n    [].slice.call(pips.children).forEach(function(p,k){p.setAttribute('aria-current',k===idx?'true':'false');});\n    count.textContent=(idx+1)+' / '+panels.length;\n    prev.disabled=idx===0; next.disabled=idx===panels.length-1;\n    if(idx===2) drawRes(resI);\n    if(idx===4) drawTP();\n    resize();\n  }\n  prev.addEventListener('click',function(){go(idx-1);});\n  next.addEventListener('click',function(){go(idx+1);});\n  document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\n    if(e.key==='ArrowRight') go(idx+1);\n    if(e.key==='ArrowLeft') go(idx-1);\n  });\n\n  /* ---- Panel 1 ---- */\n  var ARCH=[\n    {l:'Vision encoder&lt;small&gt;SigLIP2, 93.5M&lt;/small&gt;',r:'Text encoder&lt;small&gt;separate tower&lt;/small&gt;',\n     core:'Similarity matrix&lt;small&gt;no shared layers&lt;/small&gt;',tail:'Two vectors&lt;small&gt;image and text&lt;/small&gt;',\n     s:['yes','no','within each tower','fixed-size square resize','93.5M + 252M towers'],\n     n:'Dual-tower models align two independent encoders. Image indexing is cheap, but the modalities never attend to each other.'},\n    {l:'Vision encoder&lt;small&gt;632M&lt;/small&gt;',r:'Tokenizer&lt;small&gt;+ embedding&lt;/small&gt;',\n     core:'LLM decoder&lt;small&gt;causal, 2.77B&lt;/small&gt;',tail:'Hidden states&lt;small&gt;from a generative stack&lt;/small&gt;',\n     s:['yes','yes','causal','projected vision features','3.75B'],\n     n:'ColPali-style retrievers reuse a generative VLM as an encoder, carrying the parameter and compute overhead of a task it never performs.'},\n    {l:'Vision encoder&lt;small&gt;SigLIP2, 93.5M&lt;/small&gt;',r:'Tokenizer&lt;small&gt;+ embedding&lt;/small&gt;',\n     core:'LM encoder&lt;small&gt;bidirectional, 110M&lt;/small&gt;',tail:'Hidden states&lt;small&gt;per token and patch&lt;/small&gt;',\n     s:['yes','no','bidirectional','projected vision features','250M'],\n     n:'ModernVBERT swaps the causal decoder for a bidirectional encoder but still keeps a separately pretrained SigLIP2 vision tower.'},\n    {l:'Patchify&lt;small&gt;32&amp;times;32 RGB, 2-layer MLP&lt;/small&gt;',r:'Tokenizer&lt;small&gt;131,072 vocab&lt;/small&gt;',\n     core:'Multimodal encoder&lt;small&gt;16,384-token bidirectional&lt;/small&gt;',tail:'Hidden states&lt;small&gt;per token and patch&lt;/small&gt;',\n     s:['no','no','bidirectional','raw 32&amp;times;32 patches','260M / 800M'],\n     n:'NeoMME is trained from random initialization. Text uses a factorized 256-dimensional embedding; each 32&amp;times;32 RGB patch is projected by a 2-layer MLP.'}\n  ];\n  var sEl=[1,2,3,4,5].map(function(i){return document.getElementById('s'+i);});\n  function setArch(i){\n    var a=ARCH[i];\n    document.getElementById('stemL').innerHTML=a.l;\n    document.getElementById('stemR').innerHTML=a.r;\n    document.getElementById('core').innerHTML=a.core;\n    document.getElementById('tail').innerHTML=a.tail;\n    document.getElementById('archNote').innerHTML=a.n;\n    a.s.forEach(function(v,k){sEl[k].innerHTML=v;});\n    document.getElementById('stemL').className='blk'+(i===3?'':' warn');\n    [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#archChips .chip')).forEach(function(c,k){\n      c.setAttribute('aria-pressed',k===i?'true':'false');});\n    resize();\n  }\n  [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#archChips .chip')).forEach(function(c){\n    c.addEventListener('click',function(){setArch(+c.dataset.a);});\n  });\n  setArch(3);\n\n  /* ---- Panel 2 ---- */\n  var WORDS=['The','quarterly','revenue','chart','on','this','page','peaks','in','the','third','column','of','the','table'];\n  var sent=document.getElementById('sent'), rng=document.getElementById('mask'), maskV=document.getElementById('maskV');\n  var order=[7,2,11,4,14,1,9,6,12,0,10,3,13,5,8];\n  function paint(){\n    var pct=+rng.value, n=Math.round(WORDS.length*pct/100);\n    var hide={}; for(var i=0;i&lt;n;i++) hide[order[i]]=1;\n    sent.innerHTML=WORDS.map(function(w,i){\n      return '&lt;span class=&quot;tok'+(hide[i]?' mask':'')+'&quot;&gt;'+(hide[i]?'[MASK]':w)+'&lt;/span&gt;';\n    }).join(' ');\n    maskV.textContent=pct+'% masked';\n    resize();\n  }\n  rng.addEventListener('input',paint); paint();\n\n  /* ---- Panel 3 ---- */\n  var RES=[\n    {px:'768',v:'602',mb:'0.31 MB',a:0.3340,b:0.4049,cell:78},\n    {px:'1,024',v:'1,058',mb:'0.54 MB',a:0.4562,b:0.5029,cell:56},\n    {px:'1,536',v:'2,354',mb:'1.21 MB',a:0.5134,b:0.5496,cell:38},\n    {px:'2,048',v:'4,162',mb:'2.13 MB',a:0.5226,b:0.5560,cell:26}\n  ];\n  var resI=3;\n  function drawRes(i){\n    resI=i; var r=RES[i];\n    document.getElementById('page').style.backgroundSize=r.cell+'px '+r.cell+'px';\n    document.getElementById('pageCap').textContent=r.v+' vectors per square page';\n    document.getElementById('rBytes').textContent=r.mb;\n    document.getElementById('r260').textContent=r.a.toFixed(4);\n    document.getElementById('r800').textContent=r.b.toFixed(4);\n    document.getElementById('bar260').style.width=(r.a/0.60*100)+'%';\n    document.getElementById('bar800').style.width=(r.b/0.60*100)+'%';\n    [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#resChips .chip')).forEach(function(c,k){\n      c.setAttribute('aria-pressed',k===i?'true':'false');});\n  }\n  [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#resChips .chip')).forEach(function(c){\n    c.addEventListener('click',function(){drawRes(+c.dataset.r);});\n  });\n  drawRes(3);\n\n  /* ---- Panel 4 ---- */\n  var CMP=[\n    {kb:'1,536.7 kB',w:100,c:'1&amp;times;',q:'100%'},\n    {kb:'39.0 kB',w:14,c:'39.4&amp;times;',q:'99.16%'},\n    {kb:'6.0 kB',w:4,c:'255.5&amp;times;',q:'95.19%'}\n  ];\n  function setCmp(i){\n    var c=CMP[i];\n    document.getElementById('shrink').style.width=c.w+'%';\n    document.getElementById('cSize').textContent=c.kb;\n    document.getElementById('cComp').innerHTML=c.c;\n    document.getElementById('cQual').textContent=c.q;\n    [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#cmpSteps .chip')).forEach(function(b,k){\n      b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',k===i?'true':'false');});\n  }\n  [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#cmpSteps .chip')).forEach(function(b){\n    b.addEventListener('click',function(){setCmp(+b.dataset.c);});\n  });\n\n  /* ---- Panel 5 ---- */\n  var TP=[\n    {n:'NeoMME-260M',sq:'2048 px &amp;middot; 4,162 vectors',v:51.3,us:1},\n    {n:'ColModernVBERT',sq:'2048 px &amp;middot; 1,149 vectors',v:26.0,us:0},\n    {n:'ColSmol-256M',sq:'2048 px &amp;middot; 1,139 vectors',v:24.8,us:0},\n    {n:'NeoMME-800M',sq:'2048 px &amp;middot; 4,162 vectors',v:21.2,us:1},\n    {n:'Vultron Flash 0.8B',sq:'1344 px &amp;middot; 1,775 vectors',v:20.2,us:0},\n    {n:'Nemotron ColEmbed 4B v2',sq:'896 px &amp;middot; 798 vectors',v:16.8,us:0},\n    {n:'ColQwen2.5-v0.2',sq:'756 px &amp;middot; 740 vectors',v:16.1,us:0},\n    {n:'Qwen3-VL-Embedding-2B',sq:'1344 px',v:8.1,us:0}\n  ];\n  var tpBuilt=false;\n  function drawTP(){\n    var host=document.getElementById('tp');\n    if(!tpBuilt){\n      host.innerHTML=TP.map(function(r){\n        return '&lt;div class=&quot;tprow'+(r.us?' us':'')+'&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;'+r.n+'&lt;em&gt;'+r.sq+'&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;'+\n               '&lt;span class=&quot;tbar&quot;&gt;&lt;i data-w=&quot;'+(r.v/55*100)+'&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;'+\n               '&lt;span class=&quot;tpv&quot;&gt;'+r.v.toFixed(1)+'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;';\n      }).join('')+'&lt;div class=&quot;tprow&quot; style=&quot;border:0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;tpv&quot; style=&quot;color:#6E7280;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;pages/s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;';\n      tpBuilt=true;\n    }\n    [].slice.call(host.querySelectorAll('.tbar i')).forEach(function(el,k){\n      el.style.width='0%';\n      setTimeout(function(){el.style.width=el.dataset.w+'%';},60+k*70);\n    });\n  }\n\n  /* ---- height sync ---- */\n  function resize(){\n    var h=document.documentElement.offsetHeight||document.body.offsetHeight;\n    parent.postMessage({neommeExplainerHeight:h+40},'*');\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('load',resize);\n  window.addEventListener('resize',resize);\n  setTimeout(resize,120); setTimeout(resize,600);\n})();\n&lt;/script&gt;\n\"></iframe>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-key-takeaways\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></h2>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li>One bidirectional Transformer handles text and raw image patches, with no vision tower and no decoder.</li>\n   <li>NeoMME-Retriever-260M scores 0.523 nDCG@10 on ViDoRe v3, beating every evaluated model below 800M.</li>\n   <li>It matches 3.75B-parameter ColQwen2.5 on ViDoRe v3 while being 14.4× smaller.</li>\n   <li>Token pooling plus asymmetric quantization cut the index from roughly 1.5 MB to 6 kB per page.</li>\n   <li>Text-only retrieval and frozen natural-image transfer remain clear weak spots.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Check out the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.01657\"><strong>Paper</strong></a>, <a href=\"https://hf.co/collections/Hcompany/neomme\"><strong>Model Collection</strong></a> and <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/tonywu71/neomme-retriever-demo\"><strong>Demo</strong></a>. Also,&nbsp;feel free to follow us on&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/follow?screen_name=marktechpost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><mark>Twitter</mark></a></strong>&nbsp;and don’t forget to join our&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/machinelearningnews/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">150k+ML SubReddit</a></strong>&nbsp;and Subscribe to&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://magic.beehiiv.com/v1/f5e63dd4-5653-4f09-83e2-321a8b1ba526?email={{email}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">our Newsletter</a></strong>. Wait! are you on telegram?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://t.me/machinelearningresearchnews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">now you can join us on telegram as well.</a></strong></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Need to partner with us for promoting your GitHub Repo OR Hugging Face Page OR Product Release OR Webinar etc.?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://forms.gle/wbash1wF6efRj8G58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><mark>Connect with us</mark></a></strong></p>\n  <!-- MOLONGUI AUTHORSHIP PLUGIN 5.2.11 -->\n  <!-- https://www.molongui.com/wordpress-plugin-post-authors -->\n  <div class=\"m-a-box \" data-box-layout=\"slim\" data-box-position=\"below\" data-multiauthor=\"false\" data-author-id=\"1\" data-author-type=\"user\" data-author-archived=\"\">\n   <div class=\"m-a-box-container\">\n    <div class=\"m-a-box-tab m-a-box-content m-a-box-profile\" data-profile-layout=\"layout-1\" data-author-ref=\"user-1\" itemscope itemid=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Person\">\n     <div class=\"m-a-box-content-middle\">\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-avatar\" data-source=\"local\">\n       <a class=\"m-a-box-avatar-url\" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-150x150.png\" class=\"avatar avatar-150 photo\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-150x150.png 150w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-80x80.png 80w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-24x24.png 24w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-48x48.png 48w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-96x96.png 96w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-300x300.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" data-attachment-id=\"17663\" data-permalink=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/?attachment_id=17663\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM.png\" data-orig-size=\"832,778\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screen Shot 2021-09-14 at 9.02.24 AM\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM.png\"></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-social \">\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-social-icon m-a-list-social-icon\">\n        <a class=\"m-icon-container m-ico-facebook m-ico-\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/MarkTechPost/\" target=\"_self\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" aria-label=\"View Asif Razzaq's Facebook profile\"><i class=\"m-a-icon-facebook\"></i></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-social-icon m-a-list-social-icon\">\n        <a class=\"m-icon-container m-ico-twitter m-ico-\" href=\"https://twitter.com/asifrazzaq1988\" target=\"_self\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" aria-label=\"View Asif Razzaq's Twitter profile\"><i class=\"m-a-icon-twitter\"></i></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-social-icon m-a-list-social-icon\">\n        <a class=\"m-icon-container m-ico-linkedin m-ico-\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/asifrazzaq/\" target=\"_self\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" aria-label=\"View Asif Razzaq's Linkedin profile\"><i class=\"m-a-icon-linkedin\"></i></a>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-data\">\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-name\">\n        <h5 itemprop=\"name\"><a class=\"m-a-box-name-url \" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\" itemprop=\"url\"> Asif Razzaq</a></h5>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-meta\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"m-a-box-string-web\">Website</span></a>&nbsp;<span class=\"m-a-box-meta-divider\">|</span>&nbsp; <a href=\"#\" class=\"m-a-box-data-toggle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span class=\"m-a-box-string-more-posts\">+ posts</span></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-bio\" itemprop=\"description\">\n        <p>Asif Razzaq is the CEO of Marktechpost Media Inc.. As a visionary entrepreneur and engineer, Asif is committed to harnessing the potential of Artificial Intelligence for social good. His most recent endeavor is the launch of an Artificial Intelligence Media Platform, Marktechpost, which stands out for its in-depth coverage of machine learning and deep learning news that is both technically sound and easily understandable by a wide audience. The platform boasts of over 2 million monthly views, illustrating its popularity among audiences.</p>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-related\" data-related-layout=\"layout-1\"></div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- CONTENT END 2 -->\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "H 公司发布 NeoMME 系列 260M 和 800M 参数的单塔多模态编码器，摒弃视觉塔与因果解码器，在 ViDoRe v3 基准上的检索性能与 ColQwen2.5 相当，参数量仅为后者的 1/14.4",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "H 公司发布 NeoMME 系列 260M 和 800M 参数的单塔多模态编码器，摒弃视觉塔与因果解码器，在 ViDoRe v3 基准上的检索性能与 ColQwen2.5 相当，参数量仅为后者的 1/14.4",
  "summary": "H 公司发布了 NeoMME 系列模型，包含 260M 和 800M 参数的双向编码器，可通过单一 Transformer 处理多语言文本和原始 32×32 RGB 图像块，无需独立的视觉塔或因果解码器。模型从随机初始化开始训练，采用文本离散掩码扩散方法，可选择性地以可见图像块为条件输入。NeoMME-Retriever 在 ViDoRe v3 基准上以 260M 参数达到 0.523 的 nDCG@10 得分，与 37.5 亿参数的 ColQwen2.5 性能相当，参数量仅为后者的 1/14.4。800M 参数版本得分为 0.556 nDCG@10。核心架构选择包括 ALBERT 风格的因式分解嵌入、用于图像块的两层多层感知机、每六层加入全局注意力的对称滑动窗口注意力、分组查询注意力以及查询键归一化。模型支持 16384 token 的上下文长度，采用 Apache 2.0 开源协议发布，上线首日即获得 Hugging Face Transformers 支持。文本检索仍是其短板，主要受限于监督规模不足。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "单塔架构摒弃视觉塔与因果解码器",
      "explanation": "NeoMME 仅使用一个 Transformer，通过相同的层处理文本 token 和原始 32×32 图像块，从随机初始化开始训练。这消除了类似 ColPali 等模型中独立预训练视觉塔和未使用的因果解码器带来的参数与计算开销。"
    },
    {
      "point": "参数量减少 14.4 倍，检索性能表现优异",
      "explanation": "NeoMME-Retriever-260M 在 ViDoRe v3 基准上达到 0.523 的 nDCG@10 得分，与 37.5 亿参数的 ColQwen2.5 性能相当，击败了所有参数量低于 800M 的参评模型。800M 参数版本得分为 0.556 nDCG@10，比同尺寸的 Vultron Retriever Flash 低 0.9 分。"
    },
    {
      "point": "以掩码扩散去噪器形式训练，支持跨模态条件输入",
      "explanation": "预训练采用文本离散掩码扩散方法，可选择性地以可见图像块为条件输入。多模态片段采用 0.30 到 1 的损坏率，消除了仅依赖语言的捷径。跨模态消融实验证实，在 90%掩码率下，可见图像块可将掩码 token 准确率提升 38.4 至 40.5 个百分点。"
    },
    {
      "point": "通过分层 token 池化与非对称量化实现高效存储",
      "explanation": "late-interaction 索引在 float32 格式下每页高达 1.5MB，存储成本极高。采用 10 倍分层 token 池化，搭配 int8 格式的查询和文档，可将存储降至 39.0 kB（压缩 39.4 倍，nDCG@10 保留率达 99.16%）。采用 8 倍池化因子，搭配 int8 查询和二进制文档，可进一步降至 6.0 kB（压缩 255.5 倍，保留率达 95.19%）。"
    },
    {
      "point": "纯文本检索与冻结自然图像迁移存在短板",
      "explanation": "在 BEIR-15 基准上的文本检索得分为 0.4881 至 0.5126，低于 149M 参数的 LateOn 模型的 0.5722 得分，主要受限于监督规模不足（对比样本量 43 万，远低于 LateOn 的 6.6 亿）。冻结自然图像迁移和纯文本检索仍是已识别的短板。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "「当前生产环境中大多数视觉文档检索器都是二手改造的产物。ColPali 及其后续模型都将生成式视觉语言模型改造为编码器使用，最终仍保留了独立预训练的视觉塔，以及永远不会生成 token 的因果解码器。」",
    "「H 公司发布了 NeoMME 系列模型，包含 260M 和 800M 参数的双向编码器，同时摒弃了上述两个组件。仅用一个 Transformer 通过相同的层处理多语言文本 token 和原始 32×32 RGB 图像块，从随机初始化开始训练。」",
    "「NeoMME-Retriever 以 260M 参数在 ViDoRe v3 基准上达到 0.523 的 nDCG@10 得分。」",
    "「它在 ViDoRe v3 基准上的性能与 37.5 亿参数的 ColQwen2.5 相当，参数量仅为后者的 1/14.4。」",
    "「文本检索性能较弱。在 BEIR-15 基准上，晚期交互检索得分分别为 0.4881 和 0.5126，而 149M 参数的 LateOn 模型得分为 0.5722。」"
  ],
